title: Specialists join a plan by proposals written apart, in one round, not by a meeting, comments or debate.
pid: 73dc6c93-d851-465e-b0c6-beeeaed1fa15
body: |2-
  Delphi has several rounds and anonymity. Here a second round costs
  two missions, and anonymity would hide what a proposal is evidence
  of: which territory it speaks for.
